{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00947","headline":"横吹曲辞 後出塞五首 三 · 杜甫","name":"横吹曲辞 後出塞五首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"古人重守边，今人重高勳。\n岂知英雄主，出师亘长云。\n六合已一家，四夷且孤军。\n遂使貔虎士，奋身勇所闻。\n拔劒击大荒，日牧胡马羣。\n誓开玄冥北，持以奉吾君。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00947.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00947","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}